  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Actively Create Opportunities (YACO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Youth Actively Create Opportunities (YACO) Activity will increase youths positive contributions to society and collective leadership through the implementation of three main areas of intervention. YACO Component I creates partnerships in support of economic opportunities attractive to youth; Component 2 strengthens youth competencies for jobs, progressive careers, and civic life; and finally, Component 3 promotes values and experiences that underpin self-reliance such as responsibility, independence, lawfulness, strong ethics, and civic engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
